{
  "slug": "easy-tiger",
  "name": "Easy Tiger",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Catches scope creep in real time. When you ask Claude for a feature that's drifting from what you came to build, easy-tiger casually asks if you actually need it for shipping - then offers to park it for later. It's a friendly nudge, never a blocker, and stays silent when you're on track.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `easy-tiger` (Deep, on-demand scope review), `goal` (Set, view, or clear the current shipping goal that easy-tiger uses to detect scope creep)\n- **Hooks** (2): `SessionStart`, `UserPromptSubmit`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install easy-tiger@claude-community` from `OlaPietka/easy-tiger`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
